PREREQUISITES:
Print Server configured with permissions
Universal Print Agent installed on Print Server
Azure Universal Print has printers and they are shared
You can record and create a printers.csv file with your unique sharedId of printer
Universal Print Connector deployed and installed on Intune AzureAD Joined device 
Printers show available to add through Control Panel > Hardware and devices > Printers > Add Printer > printer name matches and shows "cloud" under it

Now you can create/modify this example script to run in Intune 